### Test health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Filter by category
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/books?category=systems

### Search for a title
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/books?search=deep

### Read one book (check X-Lesson response header)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/books/2

### 404 example
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/books/99

### POST request with a query value
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/echo?message=hello
